OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry and fine, with
OL,6,Fgood spells of sunshine. There may be
OL,7,Fsome infrequent, and mainly light
OL,8,Fshowers at times during the morning.
OL,9,FBlustery westerly winds during the
OL,10,Fmorning, particularly over higher
OL,11,Fground, easing in the late afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry through the
OL,14,Fevening with high cloud and some
OL,15,Fclearer skies giving some hazy evening
OL,16,Fsunshine. Winds becoming light.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,19,Fthrough the morning, mostly clearing
OL,20,Fby mid-afternoon. Blustery winds
OL,21,Fdeveloping by late-morning. Very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
