OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fon Monday, with rain and strong winds
OL,7,Fspreading in during the evening.
OL,8,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday, with
OL,9,Fgusty winds. Showers and strong winds
OL,10,Fdying away Wednesday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
